る","purpose":"進行役が作業をまとめ、調査役と確認役に依頼を渡して結果を照合します。","conductor":{"harness":"opencode","model":"anthropic:claude-sonnet-5-5"},"helpers":[{"role":"researcher","harness":"openclaw","model":"anthropic:claude-sonnet-5-5"},{"role":"reviewer","harness":"claude-code","model":"anthropic:claude-opus-5-5"}],"tools":["filesystem","fetch","playwright"],"instructions":{"style":"plan-then-act","files":["agents-md"]},"frontend":"terminal","notes":"依頼と返答は Model Memento の中継で渡します。OpenClaw は画面を開かずに1回実行し、Claude Code は返答を表示して終了する方式です。初回の準備は手動、実接続とモデルの動作は unverified。出典 https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/agent https://code.claude.com/docs/en/headless https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/overview"},{"schema":"memento.recipe.v1","id":"leader-reviewer","title":"進行役と確認役で作業する","purpose":"進行役が変更案を作り、確認役に内容を渡して見落としを探します。","conductor":{"harness":"openclaw","model":"anthropic:claude-sonnet-5-5"},"helpers":[{"role":"reviewer","harness":"claude-code","model":"anthropic:claude-opus-5-5"}],"tools":["filesystem","fetch"],"instructions":{"style":"plan-then-act","files":["agents-md"]},"frontend":"terminal","notes":"確認役への依頼と返答は Model Memento の中継で渡します。Claude Code の画面を開かずに返答を受け取る方式を使います。初回のログインと鍵の準備は手動、実接続とモデルの動作は unverified。出典 https://code.claude.com/docs/en/headless https://docs.openclaw.ai/tools/mcp https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/overview"},{"schema":"memento.recipe.v1","id":"local-ollama","title":"この端末のモデルで作業する","purpose":"モデルとアプリを用意した後、この端末で動かすモデルだけを選んで作業します。","conductor":{"harness":"opencode","model":"ollama:qwen3.5:9b"},"helpers":[],"tools":[],"instructions":{"style":"plan-then-act","files":["agents-md"]},"frontend":"terminal","notes":"事前に Ollama とモデルを用意してください。通信を完全に止める設定は unverified。出典 https://ollama.com/library/qwen3.5:9b https://docs.ollama.com/api/introduction https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode"},{"schema":"memento.recipe.v1","id":"single-harness","title":"ひとつのアプリで計画して進める","purpose":"小さな変更を計画し、作業してから結果を確認します。","conductor":{"harness":"claude-code","model":"anthropic:claude-sonnet-5-5"}